# Xfinity

> Xfinity provides internet, TV, mobile, and home services, offering connectivity and entertainment solutions for residential and business customers.

Xfinity provides internet, TV, mobile, and home security services across the United States. Its offerings include gigabit internet, streaming services, premium cable channels, and smart home solutions. Xfinity partners with major content providers and supports international and local connectivity through tailored plans and features.


